      "description": "The meme spreads misinformation by presenting a scientifically inaccurate claim ('Chocolate melts at 86°F') as fact, which can mislead viewers and undermine trust in factual knowledge. This is harmful because it promotes false information disguised as factual content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_e6fae674"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
